<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Taiwan Weighted Index. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Taiwan Weighted Index. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Wednesday it has launched 200 million warrants on the Taiwan Stock Exchange Weighted Index.</p>
<p>1,000 warrants control one index (One index = NT$1.00)</p>
<p> EXERCISE PRICE    NT$8,228	 CURRENT PRICE    NT$8,203</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.313	 PREMIUM	    13.8 PCT</p>
<p> (Corrects currency of issue price from NT$ to HK$)</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.MAR.98	GEARING	    7.4X</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	BOARD LOT	  1,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT DATE   APPROX 3 WKS FROM ISSUE</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT	 CASH</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
